WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:06.286
- So, you're being controlled
by someone on Netflix?

00:00:06.286 --> 00:00:08.673
What is Netflix, is it a planet?

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:11.320
- I don't know really.

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:14.820
Some sort of future entertainment thing.

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:16.280
- Like a computer game?

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:17.223
- I don't know.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:21.453
It's from the 21st century they said.

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:25.480
- Okay, well let's try to
pick it apart logically

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:29.650
and see if we can define if
this is reality or delusion.

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:31.400
- It's not a delusion.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.803
- Okay, let's go through it.

00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:39.310
Okay, so all of this is
happening to entertain someone.

00:00:41.119 --> 00:00:42.874
Someone who's controlling you.

00:00:42.874 --> 00:00:44.294
- Uh-huh.

00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:49.223
- So why aren't you in a
more entertaining scenario?

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.228
- What do you mean?

00:00:53.228 --> 00:00:54.752
- Well look at you.

00:00:54.752 --> 00:00:56.970
You're in a small, ordinary room,

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:58.770
in an ordinary part of the world,

00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:00.333
talking to an ordinary woman.

00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:03.550
If this was entertainment,

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:06.546
surely you'd make it more interesting,

00:01:06.546 --> 00:01:09.133
inject a little action, isn't that right?

00:01:10.971 --> 00:01:15.840
I mean, wouldn't you
want a little more action

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:18.143
if you were watching this now on telly?

00:01:20.202 --> 00:01:23.619
(tense electronic music)

00:01:29.771 --> 00:01:32.955
(tea splashes)
(therapist screams)

00:01:32.955 --> 00:01:36.622
(objects smash and clatter)

00:01:38.147 --> 00:01:40.880
Come at me, come on mummy's boy.

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:42.631
What are you waiting for?

00:01:42.631 --> 00:01:45.631
(music intensifies)

00:01:49.795 --> 00:01:52.629
Come on, I dare you.

00:01:52.629 --> 00:01:57.629
(therapist shouts)
(kick thuds)

00:01:58.577 --> 00:02:00.539
(glass smashes)

00:02:00.539 --> 00:02:03.622
(both grunt)

00:02:03.622 --> 00:02:06.363
(therapist screams)

00:02:06.363 --> 00:02:08.780
(fists thud)

00:02:18.577 --> 00:02:21.577
(music intensifies)

00:02:27.031 --> 00:02:29.448
(both grunt)

00:02:31.238 --> 00:02:35.313
- How's that for entertainment,
you psychiatric fuck?

00:02:35.313 --> 00:02:36.146
Huh?

00:02:36.146 --> 00:02:38.200
Fucked your day up good
and proper, didn't we?

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:41.293
Me and my friend from the future! (laughs)

